### teste de cadastro de motorista - rota privada
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome":"ueslei",
    "cnh":"2552",
    "cpf":"12345678990",
    "telefone":"48999545106"
}

